
"smart_sources:2026-07-24 - You Asked_ What’s happening with the former Camp Morrison property_.md": {"path":"2026-07-24 - You Asked_ What’s happening with the former Camp Morrison property_.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"18g18mg","at":1785795033966},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1785168902961,"size":5352,"at":1785795034036,"hash":"18g18mg"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,9],"#":[10,13],"#####You Asked We answer your questions | Ask one here!":[14,53],"#####You Asked We answer your questions | Ask one here!#{1}":[16,53],"##Alscott’s background and local ties":[54,66],"##Alscott’s background and local ties#{1}":[56,66]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Drew Dodson - Valley Lookout Editor","target":"Drew Dodson - Valley Lookout Editor","line":5},{"title":"Bradley Scout Reservation","target":"https://www.facebook.com/CampBradleyStanley","line":22},{"title":"Western States - Lookout creative - 4:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/115c0cfa-e547-4a5c-8f4e-7ea7e16f8bde.png","line":24,"embedded":true},{"title":"Alscott emphasized two years ago when it bought the land","target":"https://boisedev.com/news/2024/07/17/camp-morrison-alscott/","line":30},{"title":"St. Luke's Health Plan - 2026 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/3cffa70b-bd30-43bc-8a9e-62008bbc7dff.png","line":34,"embedded":true},{"title":"City of McCall - Visiting? 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/57592d17-0c69-4d28-a6e9-c5d629733da1.png","line":48,"embedded":true},{"title":"City of McCall - Visiting? 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/57592d17-0c69-4d28-a6e9-c5d629733da1.png","line":60,"embedded":true}],"metadata":{"title":"You Asked: What’s happening with the former Camp Morrison property?","source":"https://valleylookout.com/2026/07/24/you-asked-whats-happening-with-the-former-camp-morrison-property/?utm_source=boisedev-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=boisedev-am","author":["[[Drew Dodson - Valley Lookout Editor]]"],"published":"2026-07-24","created":"2026-07-27","description":"Two years ago, a wooded property on the east side of Payette Lake was sold after decades of use as a youth scout camp.  Camp Morrison, as the property was known, was purchased in June 2024 by Alscott Real Estate LLC, a Boise company controlled by the descendants of Albertsons grocery chain founder Joe Albertson.  […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},